{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "002sht_402_2_4_002_02_09_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:108b24e63fd484a68c0908bafc7f1a7f2c2d27aa669d6f0348ff9e9cf74de5b9",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:002sht_402_2_4_002_02_09_b:2_4_002_02_09_b:cmd-000007:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:345a8935c28118a5c4fcd16832a718518331fdc3ad7fc90c706357378faa6c81",
      "text": "喂～，●●●●プロデューサー？\n采购差不多快结束了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:002sht_402_2_4_002_02_09_b:2_4_002_02_09_b:cmd-000009:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a92b4b543967431931e6ae28bc280da2b99b8f5dbbad5c9f3182ee878407338",
      "text": "还有一点",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:002sht_402_2_4_002_02_09_b:2_4_002_02_09_b:cmd-000010:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f3afddd2e3d16dbb5ad04e1f1c61501b2623a9ceb23f381948578f37cbfe0126",
      "text": "现在正要\n回演播室",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:002sht_402_2_4_002_02_09_b:2_4_002_02_09_b:cmd-000013:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee4ce5bdc87b519f0dffb320d1b1e650dc10e7e2877a0c62b546ae5f1c36aaf2",
      "text": "好嘞！我现在正和大家一起参观演播室呢，\n一起等你哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:002sht_402_2_4_002_02_09_b:2_4_002_02_09_b:cmd-000015:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e0a04b7f42cf736856c612f6cc3d5acf18504fcf7894198b54bbf8a0b77ab01b",
      "text": "这里的演播室有很多不同的房间，很有趣呢，\n总觉得像秘密基地一样让人兴奋！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:002sht_402_2_4_002_02_09_b:2_4_002_02_09_b:cmd-000017:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43705b041ded01d7341b4851e7cb37d39bb2c6bda13102011491c6bf2a23386a",
      "text": "用来直播的房间，也会布置得\n很有派对氛围对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:002sht_402_2_4_002_02_09_b:2_4_002_02_09_b:cmd-000019:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:46febed9bab89a79bd98a1e35f73b31f49fa0fef250ba6443b58e21394b4d96b",
      "text": "想早点听到粉丝们的感想，\n真期待直播的那天啊～♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:002sht_402_2_4_002_02_09_b:2_4_002_02_09_b:cmd-000021:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9b9ada61fd0d9772a24131184a05adc25bf04c7b2c3a505a0e829d3ccb8b14b1",
      "text": "一起加油吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:002sht_402_2_4_002_02_09_b:2_4_002_02_09_b:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc93416aeed3a116355ac492cc97b85eea68d4491bd84778dcfafe7da771e543",
      "text": "那当然！我会把气氛炒得超级火热，\n就包在我身上吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:002sht_402_2_4_002_02_09_b:2_4_002_02_09_b:cmd-000026:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0b3381a379aa61cdb1e9f42e0c66b9fe99c886b59db8fe72bbcf5deba31bd688",
      "text": "……啊，享介先生他们好像去其他房间\n看看了！我也得去瞅瞅♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:002sht_402_2_4_002_02_09_b:2_4_002_02_09_b:cmd-000028:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00f2fc86ae956a5734fa143fc802efa71d6759aeb7bbb49557ec0508f802eaa2",
      "text": "那就制作人，\n待会儿见啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
